OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters to check structural
OL,4,Aintegrity of building after major blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have been tackling a blaze
OL,7,Fat a "residential property" in Market
OL,8,FStreet
OL,10,FAt 22:55 BST on Monday night,
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fsaid 12 fire engines were at the scene
OL,14,FA fire commander told BBC Nottingham
OL,15,Fthe blaze - in the Escobar building -
OL,16,Fspread to the roof
OL,18,FNo injuries have been reported,
OL,19,Faccording to the fire service
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
